+// Savage Blade, which applies Deadly Bite itself. Mongoose Bite and Counterattack damage apply Deadly Bite (965408: a
+// bleed of 66 + 3.4% SP + 3.4% ranged AP every 2 sec, +20% Raptor Strike and Savage Blade damage, up to 5 stacks, 12
+// sec). Deadly Bite's damage has a chance to trigger Sharpened Blade: 20% per tick (no chance survives; assumed), which
+// takes 4 sec off Savage Blade's cooldown and 1 sec off Glaive Toss's, and stacks up the next Savage Blade's damage.
+// (Its twin 272353 keeps the other design: a share of the hit, accumulated into one bleed.)
